Z||000000||LT1 Chop Top||07-29-2001||10:18 PM||||Does anyone know where I can get a 'gated' Ferrari like shifter for a Fiero 5-speed??<P>||||reg||6
Z||000001||California Kid||07-29-2001||10:57 PM||||"The Fiero Store" carried it a couple years back, it was a kit, included new shifter and gate plate (about $65).  I had one and didn't like it, the shifter was too tall (and straight, no bend to get it closer to you, I even shortened the shaft, and still didn't like it). Also the shifter didn't line up real well with the gates anyway. The under plate stretched fabric sucked too, putting too much pressure on the shifter.<P>If you really want the gated look, I would suggest you make a template to suit your exact shift pattern (plan a little clearance so you don't miss shifts), and make your own out of stainless steel.<P>Just thought I'd tell you about my experience with it.||||reg||1
